license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalizations supporting papers on Clebsch geometry, arcs complete
  outside a prescribed conic, projective Reed–Solomon deep holes, local-unitary
  rigidity of stabilizer AME states, and bounded repair ports. Version 0.3.0
  adds the structural formal companion for arithmetic and harmonic realizations
  of the Clebsch cubic, with its geometric correspondence boundary explicit.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - finite geometry
  - Clebsch geometry
  - coding theory
  - Reed–Solomon codes
  - quantum information
  - algebraic combinatorics
